-- a text as the byte string it spells (memory-is-local: a List Word and the packed buffer of its bytes
-- are one text; this is the identification read off as bytes): a text held as its bytes (V_TEXT) gives
-- its own, a list of cells is read whole and packed. Trusted: each word of the list is below 256
primitive text-bytes : (t : List Word) → Bytes (list-length t) = λ t → %textbytes t
